Bootstrap
------------------------------
1. Bootstrap  is a css framework.
2. Framework means collection of libraries.
3. Bootstrap  provide two libraries design the webpage easy and fast.
      a). css library (css library contains pre-defined classess)
      b). js library (js library contains pre-defined methods)
4. css library used to design the webpages easy and fast.
5. js library used to add the functionality to the webpage.
6. by using Bootstrap framework work deisgn the webpages easy and fast.
7. by using Bootstrap framework create the responsive webpages.

   responsive webpages means depends on device width automatically
   adjust the content.

8. Bootstrap current version is Bootstrap5.

9. You want get the any latest information about bootstrap
 you have to visit http://www.getbootstrap.com


   











